instead in the experimental version. If you use the released version (1.7-1) then it behaves as expected:

$ make
java -cp ../Rserve.jar:../../REngine.jar:. test
org.rosuda.REngine.Rserve.RserveException: eval failed, request status: authorization failed

Cheers,
Simon





